---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Builder of Builders | Zeta"
  description="Discover Zeta's Builder of Builders philosophy and how mentorship, professional development, and leadership create future leaders."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Leadership Philosophy</p>

      <h1>Building Leaders Who Develop Others</h1>

      <p>
        At Zeta, leadership is measured not only by individual achievement
        but by the ability to develop capable professionals, mentor future
        leaders, and create opportunities that extend beyond oneself. Our
        <strong>Builder of Builders</strong> philosophy is founded on the
        belief that sustainable organizations grow when people invest in the
        growth of others.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <p class="section-intro">
        Every leadership journey begins with personal growth, evolves through
        service and mentorship, and ultimately creates a lasting impact by
        developing the next generation of leaders.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        "Leadership creates its greatest impact when it empowers others to lead."
      </blockquote>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three Pillars -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell content-grid">

      <article>
        <h2>Build Professional Excellence</h2>

        <p>
          Every journey begins with a strong professional foundation.
          Individuals develop ethical standards, practical knowledge,
          disciplined work habits, and a commitment to serving clients with
          integrity and excellence.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Lead Through Service</h2>

        <p>
          Leadership is developed through consistent action, accountability,
          effective communication, and a genuine commitment to helping others
          grow. By serving first, leaders earn trust and inspire meaningful
          progress within their teams.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>Create Leaders Who Build Others</h2>

        <p>
          The ultimate goal is to develop leaders who mentor future
          professionals, strengthen teams, establish sustainable systems, and
          create opportunities that continue to benefit others for years to
          come.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
